#: scenario8:scenario8_5CE02E04_DBFD_40AC_9C60_98554641767A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a81fb71cef3563c65077925a56d91ccb57be95f34ddfd2b720fc2090b74a3bd
